        <div class="metric-item"><span>待取餐</span><strong>{{ stats.readyForPickup }}</strong><small>等待核销</small></div>
        <div class="metric-item neutral"><span>系统状态</span><strong class="status-text">运行中</strong><small>本地演示环境</small></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="business-grid">
      <section class="page-card business-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>今日经营数据</h3><span>来自工作台经营统计接口</span></div></div><div class="business-metrics"><div><span>营业额</span><strong>¥{{ Number(business.turnover).toFixed(2) }}</strong></div><div><span>有效订单</span><strong>{{ business.validOrderCount }}</strong></div><div><span>客单价</span><strong>¥{{ Number(business.unitPrice).toFixed(2) }}</strong></div><div><span>完成率</span><strong>{{ (business.orderCompletionRate * 100).toFixed(1) }}%</strong></div><div><span>新增用户</span><strong>{{ business.newUsers }}</strong></div></div></section>
      <section class="page-card business-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>商品与订单状态</h3><span>菜品、套餐及历史订单概览</span></div></div><div class="mini-status"><span>在售菜品 <b>{{ goods.dishSold }}</b></span><span>停售菜品 <b>{{ goods.dishStopped }}</b></span><span>在售套餐 <b>{{ goods.comboOnSale }}</b></span><span>停售套餐 <b>{{ goods.comboStopped }}</b></span><span>累计订单 <b>{{ orderOverview.allOrders }}</b></span><span>已完成 <b>{{ orderOverview.completedOrders }}</b></span><span>已取消 <b>{{ orderOverview.cancelledOrders }}</b></span></div></section>
    </div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      <section class="page-card task-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>待处理事项</h3><span>优先处理已支付订单</span></div><span class="task-count">{{ stats.toBeConfirmed + stats.making + stats.readyForPickup }} 项</span></div><div class="task-list"><div class="task-row"><span class="task-dot"></span><div><strong>待接单订单</strong><p>支付完成后需档口确认</p></div><b>{{ stats.toBeConfirmed }}</b><button @click="router.push('/admin/orders')">处理</button></div><div class="task-row"><span class="task-dot amber"></span><div><strong>待取餐订单</strong><p>学生到店后输入取餐码完成交接</p></div><b>{{ stats.readyForPickup }}</b><button @click="router.push('/admin/verify')">核销</button></div><div v-if="stats.toBeConfirmed + stats.making + stats.readyForPickup === 0" class="no-task">当前没有待处理订单</div></div></section>
      <section class="page-card quick-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h3>常用功能</h3><span>运营日常操作入口</span></div></div><div class="quick-list"><button @click="router.push('/admin/slots')"><span class="quick-no">01</span><div><strong>配置取餐时段</strong><small>按档口设置容量与时间</small></div><span>›</span></button><button @click="router.push('/admin/canteens')"><span class="quick-no">02</span><div><strong>维护食堂信息</strong><small>食堂、位置与营业时间</small></div><span>›</span></button><button @click="router.push('/admin/stalls')"><span class="quick-no">03</span><div><strong>维护档口信息</strong><small>档口状态与所属食堂</small></div><span>›</span></button></div></section>
    </div>
    <section class="notice-bar"><strong>运营提示</strong><span>时段容量由数据库条件更新保证，不会因为并发请求超卖；取消或超时关闭会自动释放对应时段库存。</span></section>
  </div>
</template>
